    "text": "KWQC\nwebsite\nGalena\n1 dead after car rolls down hill, hitting trees near Galena\nBy KWQC Staff,\n57 minutes agoGALENA, Ill. (KWQC) - A passenger died after a car that wasn’t in park rolled down a hill, hitting several trees. Jo Daviess County Sheriff’s deputies said 82-year-old Beverly Van Dyke-Klaersch was driving an SUV with 77-year-old William Klaersch as her passenger on West Longhollow Road in rural Galena Tuesday.",
